  "summary_en": "Korean Act promoting urban air mobility (UAM): requires master plans, designates demonstration and pilot zones with regulatory exemptions from aviation laws, regulates vertiport development, corridors and service providers, mandates liability insurance, and provides R&D, workforce and international cooperation support. Amended January 2025.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Five-year UAM master plan by the Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport",
   "Demonstration and pilot operation zones with relaxed aviation law application after National Transport Committee deliberation",
   "Permission and completion certification required for vertiport development",
   "Mandatory liability insurance for UAM service providers in pilot zones, with penalties",
   "Information system, spatial data, R&D and workforce support, and international cooperation"
  ],
